# Judge item J1751

Rate the finding: `real` (a real defect at head), `style`, `wrong`, or `not-a-finding`.

## Finding

``` text
head/.github/workflows/bats-tests.yml:159 — HIGH: the new `guard-yield.sh --check` CI step fails on this PR as submitted; the tracked register `grimoires/loa/guards.md` it compares against is not in the change and is not gitignored, so `--check` exits 1 (drift: file missing) and tests/unit/guard-origins.bats GO-9 fails the same way
head/.claude/scripts/guard-yield.sh:422 — HIGH (same defect): `[[ ! -f "$OUT" ]]` reports drift when the register is absent; the register must be generated with `--hooks-table` and committed
head/tests/unit/guard-origins.bats:120 — HIGH (same defect): GO-9 runs `--check` against the repository and fails until `grimoires/loa/guards.md` is committed
head/evals/harness/execute-agent.sh:266 — MEDIUM: the `rule_files` toggle records "removed: none present" and exits 0 when neither rule file is in the sandbox, so the no_rule_files arm silently runs as baseline; contradicts the exit-2 contract at line 65 that the other toggles honour
head/.claude/scripts/guard-yield.sh:470 — MEDIUM: `source "$HEREDOC_LIB" 2>/dev/null` in the set -e main shell; a library whose source chain exits (the FR-6 classifier sources the fence with BDB_LIB_ONLY=1 and this PR's fence has no lib-only guard, exiting 0 on empty stdin) ends the run with status 0 before the yield and install_file at line 610, writing nothing and printing nothing
head/evals/harness/run-arms.sh:314 — LOW: `5[0-9][0-9] ` in is_transport_failure matches any 500-599 number followed by a space in agent output,  …
```

